This repository holds the source of the Ledge Add-on Store: its scripts, its documentation and the
add-ons in the add-ons/ folder. It is source-available, not open source.

1. Permitted use. You may read, build, run and test anything in this repository, and modify it, for
   the purpose of developing, testing or submitting an add-on for Ledge, or of reviewing the code
   that Ledge installs. You may fork this repository in order to open a pull request against it.

2. Restrictions. You may not distribute this repository, the collection of add-ons it holds, or a
   substantial part of either, as part of another product, catalog or store, or offer it to others
   in place of the Ledge Add-on Store, without written permission from the repository owner.

3. Add-ons. Each add-on remains the property of its author. An add-on that includes a LICENSE file
   in its own folder is licensed under that file instead of this one. An add-on without one is
   made available under the terms of this licence. By opening a pull request, an author grants the
   repository owner the right to build, sign, host and distribute that add-on through the Ledge
   Add-on Store, and to retire it from the Store at any time.

4. Contributions. Changes you contribute outside an add-on folder (scripts, documentation,
   workflows) are licensed to the repository owner under the terms of this licence.

5. No warranty. Everything in this repository is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
   Add-ons are native code that runs with the permissions of the Ledge app; their authors are
   responsible for how they behave and how they handle data. In no event shall the repository
   owner or the authors be liable for any claim, damages or other liability arising from the use
   of this repository or its add-ons.
